<title>USA: Weekly broiler/egg report -- USDA.</title>
<headline>Weekly broiler/egg report -- USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Placements of broiler chicks in the 15 major producing states in the week ended Oct 5 totalled 126.673 million, versus a revised 131.304 million in the previous week and 124.964 million a year ago, the U.S. Agriculture Department said.</p>
<p>Eggs set in those states in the same week totalled 162.727 million, versus a revised 157.340 million the previous week and 162.799 million in the comparable week of last year, USDA said.</p>
</text>
